  "body": "v1.18.0\r\n\r\nSetup\r\n- Additional standalone `epiq setup` command, for when you don't want to initialize a new project also\r\n- Addiitonal `epiq init` command starts a board from a script, without the TUI\r\n- The editor falls back to $VISUAL, then $EDITOR; pick another with :config editor\r\n\r\nTUI\r\n- Quit with :q, :q!, :quit or :wq; q at the top offers :exit\r\n- Exiting leaves a clean terminal\r\n\r\nGUI\r\n- Comments read oldest first, with the composer pinned under the thread (contributed by @zz-simbe) (#579)\r\n- Prettier markdown tables \r\n- A lane the filter empties says how many tickets it hides, with a Clear\r\n- Switching board keeps tag, contributor and goal filters\r\n- The board switcher counts every ticket again, whatever the filter hides\r\n- Dense cards count the tags they can't fit",
  "mentions_count": 1
